<tr ondblclick='loadRecord(11,477, 0)'><td style='mso-number-format:"\@"'>Moyee Coffee</td><td style='mso-number-format:"\@"'>Marnix Messemaker</td><td style='mso-number-format:"\@"'>Sunbytes</td><td style='mso-number-format:"0"'>477</td><td style='mso-number-format:"\@"'>Geen recording</td><td style='mso-number-format:"\@"'>7-4-2026 15:16:24</td><td style='mso-number-format:"\@"'>Moyee Coffee</td><td style='mso-number-format:"\@"'>07-04-2026 15:16:24 Dear Hens,     Thank you for reaching out and for providing more information about Moyee Coffee. It was a pleasure speaking with you recently. While your coffee and your commitment to the production chain are very impressive, we are currently satisfied with our existing coffee setup and are not looking to make any changes at this time. Consequently, we will pass on the offer for a tasting session.     I appreciate you checking in, and we will certainly keep Moyee Coffee in mind if our needs change in the future.     Best regards,  --    Khanh Khuat</td><td style='mso-number-format:"0"'>201</td></tr>
